{"steam_appid":4298400,"steam_name":"Dystopian Pet Simulator","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4298400/853926848/293c91155dca18f5c04ab717d9b0f317c0a08ab9/1770911208/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770913148","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257285728/edb06930f217e5fafa0a4787e7107f1a469f8c6c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770913148","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/6b6678c5fc767333544e6fd33cbaf3e3db04cfbd/ss_6b6678c5fc767333544e6fd33cbaf3e3db04cfbd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793289384","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/4ab5e806cce6ed41dedc37486602d54d7f80cc61/ss_4ab5e806cce6ed41dedc37486602d54d7f80cc61.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793289384","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/0ea8d28d486aa4ffba9e9dc9185bd7189e83a86d/ss_0ea8d28d486aa4ffba9e9dc9185bd7189e83a86d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793289384","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/b9b4f420ec19809ff97a3929511e53922e93773c/ss_b9b4f420ec19809ff97a3929511e53922e93773c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793289384","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/6351da002e9a150433b0e2a492a31aa263c95953/ss_6351da002e9a150433b0e2a492a31aa263c95953.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793289384"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/5de12afc123002a0e46de83a2983bef3.webp?t=1793289384\" width=610 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>terminal operator</strong> working in a grim, dystopian industrial substructure where mutated creatures are worth more alive than dead. Your job is simple and dirty: <strong>track the target, throw a net, and deliver the capture to your personal terminal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every creature generates <strong>passive income and experience</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rarer the creature, the faster your economy grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/f62b6296f25fc806bd03687eec3620a1.poster.avif?t=1793289384\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/f62b6296f25fc806bd03687eec3620a1.webm?t=1793289384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/f62b6296f25fc806bd03687eec3620a1.mp4?t=1793289384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/2866402c8e54dc816e274e8c5a0c902e.webp?t=1793289384\" width=610 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don’t kill creatures - <strong>you exploit them</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captured mutants become assets that power your terminal, unlock new upgrades, and open the path to advanced evolutions. Combine pets, experiment with mutations, and increase their market value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more valuable the capture…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/0935e630de8104a6bd5cf689d7e480f2.poster.avif?t=1793289384\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/0935e630de8104a6bd5cf689d7e480f2.webm?t=1793289384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/0935e630de8104a6bd5cf689d7e480f2.mp4?t=1793289384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/ab777d28f59593ccb93166e647e8ff26.webp?t=1793289384\" width=610 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the zone solo or team up with <strong>up to 4 players in co-op</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together, split the risks - or compete for the most valuable captures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/69fd6b917efa1b13dddc8cb5857a6b4d.poster.avif?t=1793289384\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/69fd6b917efa1b13dddc8cb5857a6b4d.webm?t=1793289384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/69fd6b917efa1b13dddc8cb5857a6b4d.mp4?t=1793289384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/f80a0b59d57a9f4d9de267e51e7e9611.webp?t=1793289384\" width=610 height=54 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Terminal upgrades expand your capabilities:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increased storage capacity and efficiency    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced mobility and jump upgrades  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster and stronger passive economy growth  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stronger your terminal becomes, the more control you gain over the substructure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/673fac7afa9756b1b6192dfd4e5d6891.poster.avif?t=1793289384\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/673fac7afa9756b1b6192dfd4e5d6891.webm?t=1793289384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298400/extras/673fac7afa9756b1b6192dfd4e5d6891.mp4?t=1793289384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op for up to 4 players</strong> with lobbies and quick start    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rarity-based economy</strong> - rarer creatures mean higher profit  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades and evolutions</strong> - combine pets to unlock new forms and increase value</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600 / AMD Ryzen 3 3100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12400f / AMD Ryzen 5 5600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> monitor</li></ul>","genres":["Indie"],"developers":["dinca.team"],"publishers":["dinca.team"],"release_date":"Oct 29, 2026"}